@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Account holder" as User
actor "Group manager" as Manager
actor "Expense reviewer" as Reviewer
actor "Invitee" as Invitee
rectangle "SplitSmart MVP boundary" {
  component "Java Swing desktop client" as Client
  component "SplitSmart application service" as Service
  database "Relational system of record\n(proposed)" as DB
  component "Private receipt storage\n(provider undecided)" as ReceiptStore
  component "Email delivery\n(provider undecided)" as Email
  component "Secret/key management\n(undecided)" as Keys
}
User --> Client : uses
Manager --> Client : manages groups
Reviewer --> Client : reviews assigned expense
Invitee --> Client : accepts invitation
Client --> Service : authenticated requests
Service --> DB : transactional state
Service --> ReceiptStore : authorized image access
Service --> Email : outbox delivery
Service --> Keys : protect credential secrets
note bottom of Client
Swing is presentation only.
Domain rules and authorization
are enforced by the service.
end note
note bottom of Email
Only members signed out at
expense submission are emailed.
end note
@enduml
